    <p class="kicker">About the author</p>
    <h2 id="about-author">Joshua Ediale</h2>
    <p>With over 1,000 live sessions led and over 500 vocalists trained, Joshua Ediale is a worship leader, singer, songwriter and vocal coach. He has led music since 2009, served as Music Director at Christian Charismatic Church, Warri, Praise Team Director at CFI UNIBEN, and currently serves as a lead vocalist/music minister at RHOGIC Abuja. He is the author of <em>The Lead Singer's Handbook</em> and is studying music theory with Yale.</p>
